Archiverr: add the dovi_reshape video filter (libavfilter/vf_dovi_reshape.c).
It applies the reshaping curves of each frame's Dolby Vision RPU on the CPU
(polynomial and MMR mapping, following libplacebo's pl_shader_dovi_reshape),
which a profile 5 picture needs before its planes are IPT-PQ-c2. FFmpeg's
only other consumer of that metadata is the libplacebo filter, which needs
Vulkan. Written for Archiverr against the pinned Raspberry Pi fork tree
(FFMPEG_REF in the Dockerfile); applies with patch -p1 and no offsets.
Licence: LGPL-2.1-or-later (the header of the file it adds), like the FFmpeg
files it changes.
Why Archiverr carries it: see MAINTENANCE.md, "Patches we carry".

